      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I regularly try to skim the New row, and the new UI is very slow to load new thumbnails, and can only be done in slow chunks.  Old menu was also annoying, but you could \"fling\" the UI a lot faster.\nIt is currently impossible to scroll deep in the New row now, as finding your old place in the menu after visiting a world takes longer than actually visiting the world.  We're talking literal minutes.",
